      "html": "<p>Hemisilurus heterorhynchus (Bleeker, 1854). Family Siluridae. Maximum size 80 cm SL.</p><p>Type locality: Muara Kompeh, eastern Sumatra, Indonesia.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1244",
      "html": "<p>Asia: Sumatra and Borneo. Reported from the middle Mekong drainage.</p>"
    },
    {
